Date: 2026-10-12. Expanded deployment and descriptive benchmark observations, not canonical accuracy or comparative speed acceptance.
CPU production driver source: 52b367c0d32635783f70c14f68b4464fcfd85145; metric implementation matches 4ca87a344ad15d4b342cbaf73ccd6bc244b75142. CI-pinned release builds, runtime dispatch, no target-cpu=native.
Control scripts and portable source-tree recipe: 9e5986720b9855c3b220be2232eac894bacda2c4. The original direct product, repeatability, stride and instrumentation assertions remain unchanged.
Build: TMPDIR=$HOME/tmp run-heavy --mem 16G --jobs 8 -- just iqa-study-build ~/tmp/zm-iqa-expanded-20261012-binaries.
